{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2023-01-05 10:00:00', 'title': 'CENTRAL SOUTH CAROLINA MEGASITE RECEIVES CSX SELECT SITE DESIGNATION', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA., JAN. 05, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX (NASDAQ: CSX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE CENTRAL SOUTH CAROLINA MEGASITE IN LUGOFF, SOUTH CAROLINA, HAS BEEN DESIGNATED A CSX SELECT SITE.'}